**Proposition 40.5 (a fixed-feedback mixed counterexample at distance $25/8$).**
Set

$$
\begin{aligned}
 w_0&=\left(\frac{1+i\sqrt{15}}4,
             \frac{1-i\sqrt{15}}4,1,1\right),&
 U_0&=\operatorname{diag}(w_0)U_+,\\
